<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/access-control">Access Control</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Smart Lock &amp; Door Hardware</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Access Control products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s" href="/markets/access-control/rfid-cards"><span class="abbr">RC</span><span class="label">RFID Access Cards</span></a><a class="s active" href="/markets/access-control/smart-lock-assembly"><span class="abbr">SL</span><span class="label">Smart Lock &amp; Door Hardware</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the credential or lock has to do and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Access Control &middot; Smart Lock &amp; Door Hardware</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Smart lock and electronic door hardware assembly</h1><p class="mk-lede">Smart locks combine electronic, wireless and mechanical systems within a single product. PCBAs, radios, motors or actuators, batteries and mechanical components therefore need to be assembled and functionally tested as a complete unit.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-smart-lock-assembly" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Smart Lock &amp; Door Hardware &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-smart-lock-assembly" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Hana provides box-build assembly for electronic locks, readers and related door hardware, from PCBA integration through to complete product assembly and functional test. This includes the integration of electronics, wireless interfaces, power components and mechanical systems within the finished unit.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Electro-mechanical assembly</span></div><div class="desc">Integration of the PCBA, motor or actuator, battery and mechanical hardware into the complete lock or reader assembly.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Radio and electronics integration</span></div><div class="desc">Assembly and integration of BLE and other wireless interfaces, keypads, fingerprint modules and reader electronics.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Complete-unit functional test</span></div><div class="desc">Functional testing of the electronics and mechanical system together at finished-product level.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">Further detail on enclosure assembly, harness and cable integration, final test and packout is available on the Box Build capability page.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build/box-build">Explore Box Build <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:820px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Built and tested as one product</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">Smart-lock performance depends on the interaction between the electronics, wireless system and mechanical components. Hana therefore tests the assembled product at unit level, allowing radio performance, actuator operation and mechanical function to be evaluated together rather than independently at PCBA level.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">access readers, control boards for locks</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/koh-kong"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Cambodia</span></span><div class="nm">Koh Kong</div><div class="note">reader box build, final assembly</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana build the complete lock, not just its electronics?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana assembles the complete unit — board, radio, motor or actuator, battery and mechanical hardware — and tests it as a finished product, not only the circuit board.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How does Hana test a product that is both electronic and mechanical?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">The electronics, radio and mechanism are exercised together in functional test, so the lock is proven as a working unit rather than passing only at board level.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can a lock program be built in more than one country?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Lock and door-hardware assembly is qualified at more than one Hana site, so a program can be dual-sourced across countries within the same company for capacity or supply resilience.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/access-control" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Access Control market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your smart-lock program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>